    "최다 득표자가 추방됩니다 · 동률이면 모두 · 전원이 1표 이하면 아무도 추방되지 않아요" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "최다 득표자가 추방됩니다 · 동률이면 모두 · 전원이 1표 이하면 아무도 추방되지 않아요"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The player with the most votes is banished · A tie banishes everyone tied · If everyone has 1 vote or fewer, nobody is banished"
          }
        },
        "en-GB" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The player with the most votes is banished · A tie banishes everyone tied · If everyone has 1 vote or fewer, nobody is banished"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最多得票者が追放されます ・ 同数なら全員 ・ 全員が1票以下なら誰も追放されません"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "得票最多的人被放逐 · 并列则全部放逐 · 所有人都不超过1票则无人被放逐"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "得票最多的人被放逐 · 並列則全部放逐 · 所有人都不超過1票則無人被放逐"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Игрок с наибольшим числом голосов изгоняется · при равенстве — все · если у всех не больше 1 голоса, не изгоняется никто"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El más votado será expulsado · si hay empate, todos los empatados · si todos tienen 1 voto o menos, no se expulsa a nadie"
          }
        },
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wer die meisten Stimmen hat, wird verbannt · Bei Gleichstand alle Gleichauf · Haben alle höchstens 1 Stimme, wird niemand verbannt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
